      "content": "I hear how exhausting and trapped that endless loop feels, especially when every try just leads back to the same starting line. Sometimes, when the path to \"being yourself\" seems to vanish, it can help to remind yourself that your worth isn't tied to completing a specific version of existence. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional, as this profound sense of pointlessness often requires specialized support to navigate. You deserve someone to walk beside you through this marathon without you having to carry the weight alone.",
      "source": "target",
