      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy and doctors just feel like more things i have to do. more chores. more things to manage. everything just feels so loud and heavy. and sometimes i just wonder... what if the weight only goes away if i'm not here to carry it anymore? like, what if the only way to actually get some peace is to just... stop?",
